    "title": "SENIOR MENUS",
    "text": "The Jamestown Golf Course is open from 9 a.m. to 1 p.m. weekdays. Seniors should arrive for lunch at 11:30 a.m. Suggested fee is $3. Call 423-2658 for reservations 48 hours in advance.\nAll takeout meals are served with potato chips, milk and choice of three-bean salad or fruit cup.\nMonday, Jan. 19\nClosed for Martin Luther King Jr. Day\nTuesday, Jan. 20\nLemon pepper chicken, Mexican rice, capri vegetables, vegetable barley soup, sliced pears. Takeout option is turkey sandwich.\nWednesday, Jan. 21\nSwedish meatballs, mashed potatoes, broccoli florets, chicken soup, sliced melon. Takeout option is Italian grinder.\nThursday, Jan. 22\nPot roast with gravy, roasted potatoes, balsamic-glazed carrots, kale chickpea soup, chocolate chip cookie. Takeout option is Greek salad with chicken.\nFriday, Jan. 23\nSausage and pepper sandwich, roasted potatoes, cole slaw, pasta bean soup, watermelon. Takeout option is turkey and bacon sandwich.",
